Intentionally-plaintext audit log (dracon-warden hatch).

docs/design/self-healing-tasklist-2026-11-01.md is the fleet's
self-healing incident record. It quotes the exact secret-shaped
fixture strings that tripped the pre-push scan in other repos (fake
test placeholders and scrub markers) as forensic evidence — those
literals are the subject of the audit entries, not credentials, and
quoting them precisely is the point of the log. No real credential
material is stored here.

The pre-push secret scan matches those quoted shapes, so without
this hatch the commits carrying new audit entries are refused. The
hatch exempts this one file from the scan.

Hatched 2026-11-02 following the audit-doc precedent
(findings.md.plaintext). Remove this hatch if real credential
material is ever stored here.
